# Lab 03 - OSPF

## Objectives

Configure and verify:

- OSPF Area 0
- OSPF Area 10
- ABR
- Passive interfaces
- Authentication
- LSDB
- LSA types
- Summarization
- Stub areas
- Totally stubby areas
- NSSA
- Default route


# Topology

R2 -------- R3
     Area 0
       |
      R3
       |
    Area 10


# Step 1 - Configure Area 0

R2:

router ospf 1
 router-id 2.2.2.2
 network 10.23.23.0 0.0.0.3 area 0


R3:

router ospf 1
 router-id 3.3.3.3
 network 10.23.23.0 0.0.0.3 area 0


# Step 2 - Verify

show ip ospf neighbor


# Step 3 - Configure Area 10

Assign unique Area 10 networks before implementation.

Example:

router ospf 1
 network <area-10-network> <wildcard> area 10


# Step 4 - Verify ABR

show ip ospf


# Step 5 - Passive Interfaces

router ospf 1
 passive-interface loopback1


# Step 6 - Authentication

interface GigabitEthernet0/0
 ip ospf authentication message-digest
 ip ospf message-digest-key 1 md5 CCNP


# Step 7 - Examine LSDB

show ip ospf database


# Step 8 - Examine Routes

show ip route ospf


# Step 9 - Area Summarization

router ospf 1
 area 10 range <summary> <mask>


# Step 10 - Default Route

ip route 0.0.0.0 0.0.0.0 <next-hop>

router ospf 1
 default-information originate


# Step 11 - Stub Area

router ospf 1
 area 10 stub


# Step 12 - Totally Stubby

router ospf 1
 area 10 stub no-summary


# Step 13 - NSSA

router ospf 1
 area 10 nssa


# Step 14 - NSSA No Summary

router ospf 1
 area 10 nssa no-summary


# Verification

show ip ospf neighbor

show ip ospf database

show ip ospf interface

show ip ospf interface brief

show ip route ospf

show ip protocols
